{"unit_id":"gjj-star__dsh-conversation-navigator#feature-1","repo":"gjj-star/dsh-conversation-navigator","commit":"c8ba2311ce9c6ed816e169d097ce15fb00ced1f3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 会话导航的功能「按轮浏览」：把会话节点整理成轮次大纲，并将非轮次事件单独列出。点击轮次标题可跳到对应用户消息，展开箭头可查看该轮的回复和步骤。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:640-708","lib/client.js:1823-1898"]}
{"unit_id":"gjj-star__dsh-conversation-navigator#feature-2","repo":"gjj-star/dsh-conversation-navigator","commit":"c8ba2311ce9c6ed816e169d097ce15fb00ced1f3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 会话导航的功能「搜索并定位」：打开关键词输入框后筛选用户问题和助手文本。选择命中项会滚动到正文中的匹配位置，并标亮该消息里的命中词。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:532-550","lib/client.js:1090-1168","lib/client.js:1824-1848"]}
